<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-06T16:04:54.566Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 16:04:54 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups in Niger rescued 16 hostages and recovered motorcycles, weapons and ₦4.7 million, while terrorists killed several of their own members during the operation. In Burkina Faso jihadist pressure grew, prompting local leaders to hail the AES force and prompting investigations into civilian deaths and mining interests, while Russian electronic-warfare vehicles were spotted operating in Mali. Benin President Wadagni reshuffled the military after a failed coup, and Nigeria ruled out a cease-fire with Islamists, continuing its offensive. The conflict caused 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPOHlzU0U4bGlPU1QyQXNDVnBWM2FNU21TNmRDU0JBbk40MjFTOTJXSGltbUlLTW9TOWhuaHd1Y2tEQVRoUzVLdXNzVEJ3ZE1LbWlyaEkwX05mQk5QZVJRdWNvT25vM3UtdGJEV0wtS05ueDNfTnpKSmFpMnNyMmN0d1R0YUNoQWRGaHV6OE1yaTJmNlVfV0t2aXJTSk4weFg1SFh0YjhGSlh6aEJ1Y3pQT2pZMDB4QmNVMXlj?oc=5&quot;&gt;BarristerNG.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOR3B4emVUVmdjWnlMcXdSWVlVWjFncW1oRC1LZWlVSVh6SmlJS3hYOW5nM05TRmYzUDdtR0NRcHdWQWxYQjVSVFBkTktGaFQyaDRob0pwamZ5Zk5Tam8xM2c5azY2MkQzZDJoREIzSjRfV2piN0hsdjAzRTFTRzV0YkJEVHZYaU56azVBZHFtbHRsUXg3RmNsdnM1VlM0cHlu?oc=5&quot;&gt;Peoples Gazette Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxNT2JlZFN2RlcxRVdlY1dETlpoUjh2U0MtTFNYcmpNVUd5SW8zazgtRzB1M3pCYjFhRUZ4bk1XZEg1akxmbmpxQmh2SEU4a0kydUZpXzVDSkNfNTRNR0xFd21ST1BmQXFwbGY3XzhFOUtRSXNHYWt3c25pS0k1YU1YdWtMT1A4YXFIWG9IdWZYdFljTzh0WDVOa1hqVXBYd1dtNGlIeW9iRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Big News Network.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPMWlvaHVPU1BwV0hrNkt2R285d1N0c1FDajljYkEwZC1BTEJJRFJ1c1Y0a